{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And a figured stone.</b> A stone that has a figure on it, and fools gaze at it and bow down to it, and it appears as though they are bowing to the figure. And 'משכית' in the sense of 'שכיה' — that all gaze at its beauty."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:40.928726826Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}